<p dir="auto">To upgrade to the latest version of Bun, run:</p>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" dir="auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="bun upgrade"><pre>bun upgrade</pre></div>
<p dir="auto">Bun automatically releases a canary build on every commit to <code>main</code>. To upgrade to the latest canary build, run:</p>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" dir="auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="bun upgrade --canary"><pre>bun upgrade --canary</pre></div>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://github.com/oven-sh/bun/releases/tag/canary">View canary build</a></p>
